する\n * 11.操作プラグインを直接制御するため、Game#operationPluginManagerにアクセスする\n */```","ts":"1625380097.307500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3DwTV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e42eeaa4-e81d-41a1-b2a1-c7c205ef2f4f","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"```    Game.prototype.pushScene = function (scene) {\n        this._postTickTasks.push({\n            type: 0 /* PushScene */,\n            scene: scene\n        });\n    };```","ts":"1625380052.306200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+QGx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8aa435d-7d59-4fce-9bd2-6505261b895c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあroot_uriとtsserverについて相関がある、と仮定するのも難しい気はする","ts":"1625380002.305700","thread_ts":"1625380002.305700","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"znQXg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"283AD98F-E594-4236-81C7-51801B102B72","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"コード部分をあまりいじることを想定してないタイプのゲームエンジン","ts":"1625379981.305300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZKfn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60A7ED20-F5AB-47C1-A601-2DABFA48F331","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"動けばヨシ！ってことで止まっちゃってるのかな…","ts":"1625379934.304300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pXQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a170da1-7ce9-4e97-9503-e4989ed2aaed","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"んー tsserver 指定してみましたが、同じこと言われるので、本当に無いのかな…","ts":"1625379902.303800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sInzO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1fc4240d-5916-4469-a973-6ce21e6d833a","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"root_uri 正しく指定してたらそこの tsserver 使って欲しい気がするけども","ts":"1625379799.303300","team":"T03C4RC8V"