id":"e4fdfc91-914c-4764-a0c1-b572f7aa4967","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"denopsのは厳密にはちょっと違うけど","ts":"1625379259.299600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WX7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0abe8a5-7b9b-402f-b197-0774683c17b3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"\u0026gt;  ゲーム開発者が自力で require() してしまった場合、実行環境が与えるものとコンフリクトして正しく動作しない可能性があります。\nそういえばこれdenopsもハマったやつだったな、難問らしい","ts":"1625379242.299400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zR79"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a4f21c42-381f-4735-9a22-e5e4f301bfbe","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ES5...","ts":"1625379141.298800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b2H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1639389c-5bc3-4837-8171-2fb452ec6631","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"```{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES5\",\n    \"lib\": [\"es5\"],\n    \"noImplicitAny\": true,\n    \"module\": \"commonjs\" ,\n    \"outDir\": \"script\",\n    \"types\" : [],\n    \"allowUmdGlobalAccess\": true,\n    \"noImplicitUseStrict\": true\n  },\n  \"files\": [\n    \"node_modules/@akashic/akashic-engine/index.runtime.d.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"include\": [\n    \"src/**/*.ts\",\n    \"typings/console.d.ts\"\n  ]\n}```\nデフォだとこうなってますね","ts":"1625379123.298600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0RU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7bd58af0-2cb5-46a8-94db-f9e716073b0a","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"compilerOption の target 次第ですかねぇ？","ts":"1625379084.298100","thread_ts":"1625379046.297300","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z/r"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"1cc87fc8-2a65-467d-a45d-a221cd0a94a0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"tscが面倒見てくれるはずなので","ts":"1625379046.297300","thread_ts":"1625379046.297300","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mSfru"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"e6dac9f8-33d8-49e5-9e44-844bed4f8fc5","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"3年前ですね…","ts":"1625379054.297700","edited":{"user":"U06ECBRTJ","ts":"1625379060.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"opWEQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eba63648-2dc6-49bf-bf87-f4d6acba4e2b","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Akashic 開発者、知り合いがいるな","ts":"1625379052.297600","edited":{"user":"UERCTTT8B","ts":"1625379064.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"01y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1cc87fc8-2a65-467d-a45d-a221cd0a94a0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"tscが面倒見てくれるはずなので","ts":"1625379046.297300","thread_ts":"1625379046.297300","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mSfru"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e06bf120-7436-4a24-a962-213acca4c6c5","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"TypeScriptでやるなら気にしなくてもよさそう","ts":"1625379038.296800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bBe9i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27790eb1-7ac1-4ab2-98f8-2260826628f4","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"これ結構忠告古くないですか","ts":"1625379030.296600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y9eG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"15247e88-ab71-4432-a1ff-04183f460d69","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u0026gt; ゼロから TypeScript で開発する場合は、 g の型定義(d.ts ファイル)が必要になります。その場合は npm install -DE @akashic/akashic-engine を実行して(devDependencies として)Akashic Engine をインストールし、 node_modules/@akashic/akashic-engine/lib/main.d.ts をコンパイル対象に含めてください。\n\u0026gt; \n\u0026gt; akashic init --type typescript で生成される TypeScript 用テンプレートでは、最初から Akashic Engine の型定義ファイルがコンパイル対象に含まれているので、特別な対応は必要ありません。","ts":"1625379021.296300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vnz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f926dfde-8e09-4af7-b08a-b6381f150ca8","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"あらぁ","ts":"1625379010.296100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8zG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3bcf934-6111-41dd-b5a0-35b22f029da6","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"なーん","ts":"1625378999.295800","edited":{"user":"UERCTTT8B","ts":"1625379003.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FzCt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3847d01f-237d-4634-8369-cb0d2b71a4f4","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u0026gt; 動作の互換性のため、 現在のところ、ES2015 以降の構文や機能は利用しないことを強く推奨します 。これには少なくとも次の構文と機能が含まれます。","ts":"1625378997.295600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jU0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a94ac91a-81d1-427b-b454-b6aaf63102c3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"これやるなら型定義だけimportになるんですかね(このへんの知見全くないので何もわからない)","ts":"1625378965.295300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PRn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2239e67-4bcc-458a-ba20-649ac165906c","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"jest の describe みたいなもんか(import せずに使える)","ts":"1625378909.294800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oCm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7314a05b-8bb9-4f28-8409-efd7798c57f6","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://akashic-games.github.io/guide/common-pitfalls.html#@akashic/akashic-engine%E3%82%92require()/import%E3%81%97%E3%81%A6%E3%81%97%E3%81%BE%E3%81%86\u003